{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02599",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.02,
      "end_seconds": 3.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Good afternoon, how are you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.85,
      "end_seconds": 11.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "Okay, uh, so hello, thanks for fitting me in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.03,
      "end_seconds": 14.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "did you come far?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.71,
      "end_seconds": 22.14,
      "duration_seconds": 6.43,
      "text": "Not too far, you know, about half an hour by bus."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.87,
      "end_seconds": 29.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Right, what do you need help with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.38,
      "end_seconds": 38.43,
      "duration_seconds": 7.05,
      "text": "I've been passing kidney stones. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.7,
      "end_seconds": 43.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.69,
      "end_seconds": 48.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "It's been about three months, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.21,
      "end_seconds": 52.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.07,
      "end_seconds": 71.15,
      "duration_seconds": 17.08,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get aching bones as well. I mean, the aching bones? That's been for one week. As for aching bones, I'd say on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.34,
      "end_seconds": 85.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Okay, any fractures, fever or low mood at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.17,
      "end_seconds": 94.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "No fractures, fever or low mood, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.09,
      "end_seconds": 98.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "have you had any weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.25,
      "end_seconds": 102.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.64,
      "end_seconds": 106.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.45,
      "end_seconds": 108.44,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "Breathing's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.28,
      "end_seconds": 112.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.67,
      "end_seconds": 116.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "no, that side's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.82,
      "end_seconds": 120.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "alright, anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.55,
      "end_seconds": 134.59,
      "duration_seconds": 13.04,
      "text": "I have an enlarged prostate, for nearly five years. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible. Acid reflux, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.79,
      "end_seconds": 139.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "So, what's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.91,
      "end_seconds": 145.93,
      "duration_seconds": 6.02,
      "text": "Tamsulosin. I take it 0.4 milligrams, at night for the prostate"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.75,
      "end_seconds": 150.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "When did you start it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.38,
      "end_seconds": 155.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Two months now. It's lansoprazole, 30 milligrams, before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.21,
      "end_seconds": 156.91,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.85,
      "end_seconds": 162.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "I'd been on omeprazole, not any more though, I stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.4,
      "end_seconds": 178.31,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.04,
      "end_seconds": 184.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.55,
      "end_seconds": 186.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "and your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.47,
      "end_seconds": 191.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.35,
      "end_seconds": 194.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.81,
      "end_seconds": 199.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.19,
      "end_seconds": 203.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.09,
      "end_seconds": 209.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "No, um, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 210.02,
      "end_seconds": 225.81,
      "duration_seconds": 15.79,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Weight 69 kilos, pulse is 65 beats a minute. BMI works out to 24.2, SpO2 97 percent on room air, blood pressure 121 over 74, height 169 centimetres."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.49,
      "end_seconds": 228.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.01,
      "end_seconds": 232.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.16,
      "end_seconds": 235.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.8,
      "end_seconds": 239.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.29,
      "end_seconds": 253.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "Your examination is normal and there is no tenderness over the bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.63,
      "end_seconds": 269.38,
      "duration_seconds": 13.75,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. Let me tell you where I've got to. This is probably possible raised calcium from an overactive parathyroid. Vitamin D excess is still possible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.1,
      "end_seconds": 304.66,
      "duration_seconds": 17.56,
      "text": "I'll request a bone density scan, it'll help with possible hyperparathyroidism. Drink plenty of water and and avoid calcium supplements until the results. See me again after the results. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.46,
      "end_seconds": 308.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "no, that's all thanks a lot"
    }
  ]
}